    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνευ-τήρια</span></b> , τά,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tumbling</i> or <i>diving
				tricks,</i> Id. (s. v. l.). (Acc. to
			D.H.ap.<u>Et.Gen.</u>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρήν,</span>
			<i>one that plunges and butts like a lamb;</i> but rather from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνεύω</span>
			<i>butt</i> or <i>dive headlong like a ram</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρνεύς,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνειός</span>).)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
